# type(scope): description
#
# Why this change is right. What it fixes or enables, and anything a reader
# would otherwise have to reconstruct from the diff. Wrap at 72.
#
# type    build chore ci docs feat fix perf refactor revert style test
# scope   http_server device_auth wifi_manager wifi_store hw_gpio hw_i2c
#         hw_reg ssd1306 font5x7 power main docs ci        (optional)
# !       after type or scope for a breaking change
#
# Subject: lower case, imperative, no full stop, within 72 characters.
#
# Footers, when they apply:
#   Fixes: #123
#   Refs: #123
#   BREAKING CHANGE: what breaks and what to do instead
